@StudentManagementAPI_HostAddress = http://localhost:5105

GET {{StudentManagementAPI_HostAddress}}/weatherforecast/
Accept: application/json

###

### Add a new student
POST http://localhost:5105/api/student
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Amit",
  "email": "amit@gmail.com",
  "course": "Artificial Intelligence",
  "age": 22
}


### Update student
PUT http://localhost:5105/api/student/3
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Amit Sharma",
  "email": "amitsharma@gmail.com",
  "course": "Data Science",
  "age": 23
}


### Delete student
DELETE http://localhost:5105/api/student/3
